# ============================================================
# Root .gitignore — ONLY server code (s/) is pushed to repo
# Everything else at root is excluded (secrets, editor state,
# the VS Code extension (e/), zip backups, notes with keys).
# ============================================================

# Ignore everything at root level except s/ and .gitignore
/*
!.gitignore
!s/

# Root-level secrets & sensitive notes (MUST NEVER BE PUSHED)
1.md
Google  api doc.md
monu.md
project-analysis.html
s.zip

# Editor / IDE state at root
.vscode/
.zombiecoder/
.idea/
